abstract: "High-performance Yar RPC server for OpenResty. An OPM adapter layer built on lua-yar — provides cosocket injection, content_by_lua handlers, and process-level instance management for HTTP / TCP stream Yar RPC services. Interoperable with PHP Yar / yar-c."
